ype": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 109, "type": "PrimitiveInt", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.18.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveInt", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [254, 255], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [620, 680], "pos": [270, -880], "widgets_values": ["A lush neo-soul track anchored by a warm Rhodes electric piano playing rich ninth and thirteenth chords over a loose, soulful live drum groove with heavy use of ghost notes and rim shots. A fretless bass provides a melodic, singing counterline beneath the harmony. The lead vocalist is a powerful, expressive woman who moves fluidly between a smoky chest voice and an airy falsetto, employing tasteful melismatic runs and bluesy bends. A tight three-part vocal harmony stack fills out the chorus. A muted trumpet and alto saxophone trade fills during the instrumental bridge, channeling the spirit of classic 1970s soul. The production is warm and analog-sounding, with subtle tape saturation and a slight room ambience.", "[Intro — Rhodes piano and brushed drums]\n[Verse 1]\nYou never call when the neon goes dark\nJust send a signal like an afterthought\nI learned to read the silence between the lines\nAnd honey that's a language I know too well by now\n[Pre-Chorus]\nMaybe I'm the fool who kept the door wide open\nMaybe you're the draft that keeps on blowing through\n[Chorus]\nI'm done rewriting your story in my head\nDone saving room for someone who's already gone\nI'll keep the record on\nBut I'll stop singing your part\n[Instrumental Bridge — Muted trumpet and alto saxophone trade phrases]\n[Verse 2]\nThe coffee shop still plays our favourite song\nI ordered something different, stayed too long\nBut every note just proved that I was right\nTo let the whole thing go before it burned my life\n[Final Chorus — Layered harmonies, fuller arrangement]\n[Outro — Rhodes vamp fades, final bass note sustains]\n", 0, "fixed", 120, 120, "4", "en", "E minor", true, 2, 0.85, 1, 0, 0], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 261, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 264, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "link": 251, "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "timesignature"}, "name": "timesignature", "label": "timesignature", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "timesignature"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "keyscale"}, "name": "keyscale", "label": "keyscale", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "keyscale"}, {"widget": {"name": "generate_audio_codes"}, "name": "generate_audio_codes", "label": "generate_audio_codes", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "generate_audio_codes"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localiz